body: "## Outcome\nEvery mutating pm action leaves a permanent, tamper-evident record. Any item is restorable to any recorded version. A third party holding only an exported proof bundle can confirm the recorded history was never altered.\n\n## Standing invariant this closes\nThe product invariant states that all mutating actions record permanently and immutably. Today item mutations satisfy it; workspace-scoped mutations (pm-klo8) do not, the completeness gate proving it (pm-9yfo) is not built, portable proof (pm-3z0k) is not exported, and authorship (pm-u14c) is self-asserted.\n\n## Delivery chain\npm-9yfo completeness gate (phase 1 item scope first) -> pm-klo8 workspace audit stream -> pm-3z0k portable attestation -> pm-u14c per-entry signatures. Compaction, redaction, and repair paths must each be proven not to break replay.\n\n## Explicit non-goals\nNo history rewriting to fix legacy gaps. No hand-attribution of legacy unknown-author events."
